        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.68
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        339,
        2031,
        1686,
        2176
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The campaign among the City workers this year will be headed by Commissioner Edward F. Cavanagh, Jr., of the Department of Marine and Aviation. Please help him in every way you can.",
